stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connected: socket auth<br/>auto-joins profile + team rooms
    Connected --> InForumRoom: opens a forum<br/>emit join_room
    InForumRoom --> Connected: leaves the forum<br/>emit leave_room
    InForumRoom --> Disconnected: connection lost
    Disconnected --> Connected: reconnect<br/>then re-emit join_room
    InForumRoom --> [*]: app closed

    note right of InForumRoom
        leave_room does not exist today.
        Opening forum A then forum B
        leaves the client in both rooms
        until the socket drops.
    end note
